<myopenmath xmlns:pi="http://pretextbook.org/2020/pretext/internal" id="270152">
<statement>
<p>
Let <m>\displaystyle{S}</m> be the universal set, where: </p>
<p><m>\displaystyle{S}={\left\lbrace{1},{2},{3},{4},{5},{6}\right\rbrace}</m></p>
<p> Let sets <m>\displaystyle{A}</m> and <m>\displaystyle{B}</m> be subsets of <m>\displaystyle{S}</m>, where:</p>
<p> Set <m>\displaystyle{A}={\left\lbrace{3},{5},{6}\right\rbrace}</m> </p>
<p> Set <m>\displaystyle{B}={\left\lbrace{3},{6}\right\rbrace}</m>  </p>
<p> Set <m>\displaystyle{C}={\left\lbrace{2},{4},{5},{6}\right\rbrace}</m></p>
<p>Write out the following sets in roster notation. </p>
<p> <m>\displaystyle{A}\cup{B}={\lbrace}</m> <fillin characters="20" /> <m>\displaystyle\rbrace</m></p>
<p> <m>\displaystyle{A}\cap{B}={\lbrace}</m> <fillin characters="20" /> <m>\displaystyle\rbrace</m></p>
<p> <m>\displaystyle{A}\cap{C}={\lbrace}</m> <fillin characters="20" /> <m>\displaystyle\rbrace</m> </p>
<p> <m>\displaystyle{A}\cup{C}={\lbrace}</m> <fillin characters="20" /> <m>\displaystyle\rbrace</m></p>
<p> <m>\displaystyle{B}\cap{C}={\lbrace}</m> <fillin characters="20" /> <m>\displaystyle\rbrace</m> </p>
<p> <m>\displaystyle{B}\cup{C}={\lbrace}</m> <fillin characters="20" /> <m>\displaystyle\rbrace</m></p>
</statement>
<solution>
<p><ul><li>3,5,6</li><li>3,6</li><li>5,6</li><li>3,5,6,4,2</li><li>6</li><li>4,5,2,6,3</li></ul></p>
</solution>
</myopenmath>

